{"seq":2,"slug":"texture-blending","title":"纹理混合系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/texture-blending","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"纹理混合系统\">纹理混合系统</h1><p>地形表面不是单一材质：山顶是裸岩和积雪，山坡是岩石，平地是草地，河岸是沙地和泥土。纹理混合系统根据地形的高度、坡度和生物群落信息，在多种材质之间平滑过渡，产生视觉自然的地表表现，而无需美工逐像素绘制每块土地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>坡度遮罩</strong>：从高度图差分计算法线，用法线 Y 分量（越大越平）决定草地权重，用 1-Y（越大越陡）决定岩石权重，自动在平地铺草、陡坡露岩</li>\n<li><strong>Height Blending（高度感知混合）</strong>：在材质权重上叠加各材质的高度贴图采样，权重高且自身高度值高的材质&quot;压过&quot;其他材质，产生岩石从草地缝隙中钻出的自然效果</li>\n<li><strong>三平面映射（Triplanar Mapping）</strong>：对陡峭地形从 X/Y/Z 三个轴方向分别采样纹理并按法线加权混合，消除垂直岩壁上 UV 拉伸造成的纹理扭曲</li>\n<li><strong>权重贴图烘焙</strong>：将高度、坡度、生物群落计算的混合权重预先烘焙到低分辨率纹理（BC3 压缩），运行时 Shader 直接采样，无需重复计算</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    H[高度图] --&gt; S[坡度计算]&#10;    H --&gt; HW[高度权重]&#10;    S --&gt; SW[坡度遮罩]&#10;    B[生物群落图] --&gt; BW[生物群落权重]&#10;    HW &amp; SW &amp; BW --&gt; M[Weight Map 烘焙]&#10;    M --&gt; HB[Height Blending]&#10;    HB --&gt; TP[三平面映射修正]&#10;    TP --&gt; OUT[最终地表颜色]\">flowchart LR\n    H[高度图] --&gt; S[坡度计算]\n    H --&gt; HW[高度权重]\n    S --&gt; SW[坡度遮罩]\n    B[生物群落图] --&gt; BW[生物群落权重]\n    HW &amp; SW &amp; BW --&gt; M[Weight Map 烘焙]\n    M --&gt; HB[Height Blending]\n    HB --&gt; TP[三平面映射修正]\n    TP --&gt; OUT[最终地表颜色]</pre><h2 id=\"基础权重混合\">基础权重混合</h2><p>最简单的纹理混合方案是<strong>基于高度的线性插值</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// Fragment Shader 基础版&#10;uniform sampler2D u_grass;   // 草地纹理&#10;uniform sampler2D u_rock;    // 岩石纹理&#10;uniform sampler2D u_snow;    // 积雪纹理&#10;&#10;float height = texture(u_heightmap, uv).r; // 归一化高度 [0,1]&#10;&#10;// 计算各层权重&#10;float grassWeight = smoothstep(0.3, 0.5, height);   // 中低海拔有草&#10;grassWeight      *= 1.0 - smoothstep(0.5, 0.7, height); // 高海拔无草&#10;float rockWeight  = smoothstep(0.4, 0.6, height);&#10;float snowWeight  = smoothstep(0.7, 0.9, height);&#10;&#10;// 归一化权重（使总和为 1）&#10;float total = grassWeight + rockWeight + snowWeight + 1e-5;&#10;grassWeight /= total; rockWeight /= total; snowWeight /= total;&#10;&#10;// 混合纹理&#10;vec4 color = texture(u_grass, uv * tilingGrass) * grassWeight&#10;           + texture(u_rock,  uv * tilingRock)  * rockWeight&#10;           + texture(u_snow,  uv * tilingSnow)  * snowWeight;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Fragment Shader 基础版</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform sampler2D u_grass;   // 草地纹理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform sampler2D u_rock;    // 岩石纹理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform sampler2D u_snow;    // 积雪纹理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float height = texture(u_heightmap, uv).r; // 归一化高度 [0,1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 计算各层权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float grassWeight = smoothstep(0.3, 0.5, height);   // 中低海拔有草</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>grassWeight      *= 1.0 - smoothstep(0.5, 0.7, height); // 高海拔无草</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float rockWeight  = smoothstep(0.4, 0.6, height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float snowWeight  = smoothstep(0.7, 0.9, height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 归一化权重（使总和为 1）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float total = grassWeight + rockWeight + snowWeight + 1e-5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>grassWeight /= total; rockWeight /= total; snowWeight /= total;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 混合纹理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec4 color = texture(u_grass, uv * tilingGrass) * grassWeight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           + texture(u_rock,  uv * tilingRock)  * rockWeight</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           + texture(u_snow,  uv * tilingSnow)  * snowWeight;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个方案效果基础，但存在两个问题：高度过渡带看起来像&quot;分层蛋糕&quot;（过渡太线性），且没有考虑坡度（垂直岩壁和水平草地应该用不同纹理）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"坡度遮罩\">坡度遮罩</h2><p>坡度信息来自高度图的梯度，在 Shader 中实时计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// 从高度图差分计算法线和坡度&#10;vec2 texel = 1.0 / textureSize(u_heightmap, 0);&#10;float h_right = texture(u_heightmap, uv + vec2(texel.x, 0)).r;&#10;float h_left  = texture(u_heightmap, uv - vec2(texel.x, 0)).r;&#10;float h_up    = texture(u_heightmap, uv + vec2(0, texel.y)).r;&#10;float h_down  = texture(u_heightmap, uv - vec2(0, texel.y)).r;&#10;&#10;// 法线向量（高度图法线空间）&#10;vec3 normal = normalize(vec3(&#10;    (h_left  - h_right) * u_heightScale,&#10;    2.0 * u_cellSize,              // 固定水平距离&#10;    (h_down  - h_up   ) * u_heightScale&#10;));&#10;&#10;// 坡度角（与垂直向上方向的夹角余弦）&#10;float slope = dot(normal, vec3(0, 1, 0)); // 1=水平, 0=垂直&#10;&#10;// 岩石在陡坡处覆盖草地&#10;float slopeRock = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.6, 0.8, slope);&#10;// 将坡度岩石叠加到权重&#10;rockWeight = max(rockWeight, slopeRock * 0.9);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 从高度图差分计算法线和坡度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec2 texel = 1.0 / textureSize(u_heightmap, 0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_right = texture(u_heightmap, uv + vec2(texel.x, 0)).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_left  = texture(u_heightmap, uv - vec2(texel.x, 0)).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_up    = texture(u_heightmap, uv + vec2(0, texel.y)).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_down  = texture(u_heightmap, uv - vec2(0, texel.y)).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 法线向量（高度图法线空间）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 normal = normalize(vec3(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (h_left  - h_right) * u_heightScale,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2.0 * u_cellSize,              // 固定水平距离</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (h_down  - h_up   ) * u_heightScale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 坡度角（与垂直向上方向的夹角余弦）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float slope = dot(normal, vec3(0, 1, 0)); // 1=水平, 0=垂直</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 岩石在陡坡处覆盖草地</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float slopeRock = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.6, 0.8, slope);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 将坡度岩石叠加到权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>rockWeight = max(rockWeight, slopeRock * 0.9);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>坡度 + 高度两个维度的组合覆盖了大多数自然地貌情况：陡坡是裸岩，高处平地是积雪，低处平地是草地，高处陡坡是裸岩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高度感知纹理混合-height-based-blending\">高度感知纹理混合（Height-Based Blending）</h2><p>线性权重混合在过渡带产生均匀的&quot;糊状&quot;，视觉上不如材质之间按&quot;厚度&quot;叠加的效果。<strong>高度感知混合</strong>（又称 Height Blending）利用材质的高度图（Heightmap，反映材质凸凹程度）来决定哪个材质&quot;更突出&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// 高度感知混合——每个材质有自己的高度信息&#10;uniform sampler2D u_grass_height;  // 草地的高度贴图（草茎高低）&#10;uniform sampler2D u_rock_height;   // 岩石的高度贴图（岩石凸凹）&#10;&#10;float grassH = texture(u_grass_height, uv * tiling).r;&#10;float rockH  = texture(u_rock_height,  uv * tiling).r;&#10;&#10;// 加权后的高度：权重高 + 材质本身高 = 在该点&quot;更突出&quot;&#10;float h_grass = grassWeight + grassH;&#10;float h_rock  = rockWeight  + rockH;&#10;&#10;// 取&quot;最突出&quot;的材质（带平滑过渡）&#10;float blend_sharpness = 0.2; // 越小过渡越清晰&#10;float h_max = max(h_grass, h_rock);&#10;float w_grass = max(h_grass - (h_max - blend_sharpness), 0.0);&#10;float w_rock  = max(h_rock  - (h_max - blend_sharpness), 0.0);&#10;float total   = w_grass + w_rock + 1e-5;&#10;w_grass /= total; w_rock /= total;&#10;&#10;vec4 color = texture(u_grass, uv*tG) * w_grass&#10;           + texture(u_rock,  uv*tR) * w_rock;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 高度感知混合——每个材质有自己的高度信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform sampler2D u_grass_height;  // 草地的高度贴图（草茎高低）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>uniform sampler2D u_rock_height;   // 岩石的高度贴图（岩石凸凹）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float grassH = texture(u_grass_height, uv * tiling).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float rockH  = texture(u_rock_height,  uv * tiling).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 加权后的高度：权重高 + 材质本身高 = 在该点\"更突出\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_grass = grassWeight + grassH;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_rock  = rockWeight  + rockH;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 取\"最突出\"的材质（带平滑过渡）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float blend_sharpness = 0.2; // 越小过渡越清晰</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float h_max = max(h_grass, h_rock);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float w_grass = max(h_grass - (h_max - blend_sharpness), 0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float w_rock  = max(h_rock  - (h_max - blend_sharpness), 0.0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float total   = w_grass + w_rock + 1e-5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>w_grass /= total; w_rock /= total;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec4 color = texture(u_grass, uv*tG) * w_grass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           + texture(u_rock,  uv*tR) * w_rock;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>高度感知混合产生更自然的材质边界：石缝之间会有草长出来，岩石突出处没有草覆盖，过渡带带有凸凹感而不是均匀糊色。这是 Unreal Engine Landscape 使用的主要混合技术。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多层材质系统\">多层材质系统</h2><p>完整的游戏地形通常需要 5-8 种材质同时混合。材质层以数组形式管理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// 每个材质层的数据&#10;struct TerrainLayer {&#10;    sampler2D albedo;      // 颜色贴图&#10;    sampler2D normal;      // 法线贴图&#10;    sampler2D roughness;   // 粗糙度（PBR）&#10;    sampler2D heightMap;   // 用于高度混合&#10;    float tiling;          // UV 平铺密度&#10;    float minHeight;       // 出现的最低高度&#10;    float maxHeight;       // 出现的最高高度&#10;    float minSlope;        // 最低坡度阈值&#10;    float maxSlope;        // 最高坡度阈值&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 混合权重存储在 4 张 RG 纹理中（每张存 2 层，最多 8 层）&#10;// 或使用一张 RGBA 贴图存 4 层权重\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 每个材质层的数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct TerrainLayer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sampler2D albedo;      // 颜色贴图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sampler2D normal;      // 法线贴图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sampler2D roughness;   // 粗糙度（PBR）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sampler2D heightMap;   // 用于高度混合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float tiling;          // UV 平铺密度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float minHeight;       // 出现的最低高度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float maxHeight;       // 出现的最高高度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float minSlope;        // 最低坡度阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float maxSlope;        // 最高坡度阈值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 混合权重存储在 4 张 RG 纹理中（每张存 2 层，最多 8 层）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 或使用一张 RGBA 贴图存 4 层权重</span></span></code></pre></div><p>权重贴图可以由程序化规则生成，也可以由关卡美术手动刷入（与程序化规则混合），提供创作自由度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"法线贴图混合\">法线贴图混合</h2><p>混合颜色的同时，法线也需要混合，以产生正确的光照效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// 混合法线——在切线空间中&#10;vec3 n_grass = texture(u_grass_normal, uv * tG).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;&#10;vec3 n_rock  = texture(u_rock_normal,  uv * tR).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;&#10;&#10;// 用 Reoriented Normal Mapping (RNM) 混合法线&#10;// 简化版：直接权重混合后归一化&#10;vec3 n_blended = normalize(n_grass * w_grass + n_rock * w_rock);&#10;&#10;// 将切线空间法线变换到世界空间（用 TBN 矩阵）&#10;vec3 worldNormal = normalize(TBN * n_blended);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 混合法线——在切线空间中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 n_grass = texture(u_grass_normal, uv * tG).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 n_rock  = texture(u_rock_normal,  uv * tR).rgb * 2.0 - 1.0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用 Reoriented Normal Mapping (RNM) 混合法线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 简化版：直接权重混合后归一化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 n_blended = normalize(n_grass * w_grass + n_rock * w_rock);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 将切线空间法线变换到世界空间（用 TBN 矩阵）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 worldNormal = normalize(TBN * n_blended);</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"宏观细节-macro-details\">宏观细节（Macro Details）</h2><p>对于大型地形，单一纹理在近处会产生明显的重复感（&quot;纹理平铺&quot;）。解决方案有两种：</p>\n<h3 id=\"宏观颜色变化-color-variation\">宏观颜色变化（Color Variation）</h3><p>在基础纹理上叠加低频颜色变化，打破规律性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"// 低频颜色变化噪声（与 UV 无关，基于世界坐标）&#10;float variation = texture(u_color_variation, worldXZ * 0.001).r;&#10;float colorMod = mix(0.9, 1.1, variation); // 0.9x 到 1.1x 亮度变化&#10;color.rgb *= colorMod;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 低频颜色变化噪声（与 UV 无关，基于世界坐标）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float variation = texture(u_color_variation, worldXZ * 0.001).r;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>float colorMod = mix(0.9, 1.1, variation); // 0.9x 到 1.1x 亮度变化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>color.rgb *= colorMod;</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"三平面映射-triplanar-mapping\">三平面映射（Triplanar Mapping）</h3><p>陡坡处纹理会被严重拉伸（UV 在垂直方向密集采样水平方向稀疏）。三平面映射从三个轴向采样并混合，消除拉伸：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"glsl\" data-code=\"vec3 weights = abs(worldNormal);  // 三个轴的权重&#10;weights = pow(weights, vec3(4.0));  // 锐化过渡带&#10;weights /= dot(weights, vec3(1.0)); // 归一化&#10;&#10;// 从三个轴分别采样纹理&#10;vec4 cx = texture(u_rock, worldPos.yz * tiling);  // YZ 面&#10;vec4 cy = texture(u_rock, worldPos.xz * tiling);  // XZ 面&#10;vec4 cz = texture(u_rock, worldPos.xy * tiling);  // XY 面&#10;&#10;vec4 triplanar = cx * weights.x + cy * weights.y + cz * weights.z;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>vec3 weights = abs(worldNormal);  // 三个轴的权重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>weights = pow(weights, vec3(4.0));  // 锐化过渡带</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>weights /= dot(weights, vec3(1.0)); // 归一化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 从三个轴分别采样纹理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec4 cx = texture(u_rock, worldPos.yz * tiling);  // YZ 面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec4 cy = texture(u_rock, worldPos.xz * tiling);  // XZ 面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec4 cz = texture(u_rock, worldPos.xy * tiling);  // XY 面</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>vec4 triplanar = cx * weights.x + cy * weights.y + cz * weights.z;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三平面映射的成本是 3 次纹理采样而非 1 次，但只需在坡度较大（<code>slope &lt; 0.7</code>）的区域启用，否则退化为普通 UV 采样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地形材质烘焙\">地形材质烘焙</h2><p>对于静态地形（非实时生成），将混合权重预先烘焙到权重贴图可以节省运行时计算：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"void bakeWeightMap(const Heightmap&amp; hm, const SlopeMap&amp; slopes,&#10;                   const BiomeMap&amp; biomes,&#10;                   Texture2D&lt;glm::vec4&gt;&amp; weightMap) {&#10;    int w = weightMap.width, h = weightMap.height;&#10;    for (int z = 0; z &lt; h; z++) {&#10;        for (int x = 0; x &lt; w; x++) {&#10;            float height = hm.at(x * hm.width / w, z * hm.height / h);&#10;            float slope  = slopes.at(x * slopes.width / w, ...);&#10;            BiomeType biome = biomes.sample(x, z);&#10;&#10;            // 计算四层权重（R=草, G=岩石, B=雪, A=沙）&#10;            glm::vec4 weights = computeWeights(height, slope, biome);&#10;            weightMap.at(x, z) = weights;&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bakeWeightMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Heightmap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> hm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SlopeMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> slopes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                   const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> BiomeMap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> biomes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">                   Texture2D</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vec4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> weightMap</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weightMap.width, h </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weightMap.height;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h; z</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w; x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w, z </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hm.height </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slope  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slopes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> slopes.width </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w, ...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            BiomeType biome </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> biomes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sample</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, z);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 计算四层权重（R=草, G=岩石, B=雪, A=沙）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            glm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vec4 weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeWeights</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(height, slope, biome);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            weightMap.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(x, z) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weights;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>烘焙权重贴图通常使用 BC3（DXT5）压缩格式，以 1024×1024 分辨率存储整个地形的材质分布，内存约 1MB，运行时访问无需任何计算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"纹理混合技术对比\">纹理混合技术对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础高度线性混合</td>\n<td>归一化高度</td>\n<td>实现简单</td>\n<td>过渡带线性，缺乏自然感</td>\n<td>快速原型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>坡度遮罩混合</td>\n<td>高度 + 法线</td>\n<td>陡坡自动露岩，真实自然</td>\n<td>需实时差分计算</td>\n<td>主流方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Height Blending</td>\n<td>权重 + 高度贴图</td>\n<td>材质边界有层次感</td>\n<td>Shader 计算量更大</td>\n<td>AAA 地面材质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三平面映射</td>\n<td>世界空间坐标 + 法线</td>\n<td>消除陡坡 UV 拉伸</td>\n<td>每像素 3 次纹理采样</td>\n<td>垂直岩壁/悬崖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权重贴图烘焙</td>\n<td>离线预计算</td>\n<td>运行时零计算</td>\n<td>不支持实时地形修改</td>\n<td>静态大地形</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>地形纹理混合从基础高度线性插值出发，通过坡度遮罩（法线 Y 分量驱动草岩边界）、Height Blending（高度贴图偏置产生岩石突出效果）、三平面映射（消除垂直面 UV 拉伸）三层技术逐步提升质量。权重贴图烘焙是标准性能优化：一次离线烘焙将复杂计算结果存入 BC3 压缩贴图，运行时 Shader 采样一次即得全部权重，将 Fragment Shader 的计算量降低数十倍。实际项目中通常组合使用：实时坡度遮罩处理动态修改的地形，烘焙权重图处理静态区域，三平面映射仅在法线 Y &lt; 0.5 的陡峭区域按需启用。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"纹理混合系统","id":"纹理混合系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基础权重混合","id":"基础权重混合"},{"level":2,"text":"坡度遮罩","id":"坡度遮罩"},{"level":2,"text":"高度感知纹理混合（Height-Based Blending）","id":"高度感知纹理混合-height-based-blending"},{"level":2,"text":"多层材质系统","id":"多层材质系统"},{"level":2,"text":"法线贴图混合","id":"法线贴图混合"},{"level":2,"text":"宏观细节（Macro Details）","id":"宏观细节-macro-details"},{"level":3,"text":"宏观颜色变化（Color Variation）","id":"宏观颜色变化-color-variation"},{"level":3,"text":"三平面映射（Triplanar Mapping）","id":"三平面映射-triplanar-mapping"},{"level":2,"text":"地形材质烘焙","id":"地形材质烘焙"},{"level":2,"text":"纹理混合技术对比","id":"纹理混合技术对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"地形 LOD 系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/terrain-lod"},"next":{"title":"植被布置系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-procedural-terrain/rendering/vegetation-placement"}}